{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK22GrantPermissionRequestV6effectAA0D6EffectOSgvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"effect"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16PermissionEffectO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PermissionEffect"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"effect","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"B1: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"allow\""},{"type":"text","text":" (the default) or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"deny\""},{"type":"text","text":". A deny grant "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"overrides every allow","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", at any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth of the resource hierarchy and at equal specificity — it is not most-specific-wins."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"claude_dev\/deny-override-design.md"},{"text":" for the precedence table and for why that trade","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"was made. Omitting the field means ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"allow\""},{"text":", so every existing client keeps working","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unchanged and no migration is required.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effect","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PermissionEffect","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16PermissionEffectO","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/grantpermissionrequest\/effect"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest\/effect","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PermissionEffect":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether a grant permits an action or refuses it (B1, deny-override). # Precedence Default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deny -> an ["},{"code":"PermissionEffect::Allow","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] grant permits -> a ["},{"code":"PermissionEffect::Deny","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] grant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses, "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and beats every allow"}]},{"type":"text","text":", wherever either sits in the resource hierarchy. Deny"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wins; there is no most-specific-wins tie-break. That choice is deliberate and is argued in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full in "},{"code":"claude_dev\/deny-override-design.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" §2.1. The short version: deny-override buys one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checkable property — "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"adding a deny rule can never widen access, and can never be undone by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"adding allows"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — and most-specific-wins buys expressiveness at the cost of making “is X"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"denied?” unanswerable without enumerating every other rule that might out-specify it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"["},{"code":"PermissionEffect::Allow","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] is the default, so data written before this existed, and clients"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that send no "},{"code":"effect","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", both mean “allow”. No migration."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PermissionEffect","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PermissionEffect","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PermissionEffect","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/permissioneffect"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GrantPermissionRequest/effect":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effect","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PermissionEffect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16PermissionEffectO"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"B1: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"allow\""},{"type":"text","text":" (the default) or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"deny\""},{"text":". A deny grant ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"overrides every allow"}]},{"type":"text","text":", at any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth of the resource hierarchy and at equal specificity — it is not most-specific-wins."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"claude_dev\/deny-override-design.md"},{"type":"text","text":" for the precedence table and for why that trade"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was made. Omitting the field means "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"allow\""},{"type":"text","text":", so every existing client keeps working"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unchanged and no migration is required."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest\/effect","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/grantpermissionrequest\/effect","type":"topic","title":"effect"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GrantPermissionRequest":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/grantpermissionrequest","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"GrantPermissionRequest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" schema."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GrantPermissionRequest"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GrantPermissionRequest"}],"title":"GrantPermissionRequest","kind":"symbol"}}}